Dear Brent,

=20

Thank you for your email and for confirming that I am not officially repres=
ented.=20

=20

I haven=E2=80=99t read the typographies corrections, and I haven=E2=80=99t read the dra=
ft order since the day I received it.

=20

Could you please confirm the following:
Do I have the right to be represented properly? If I want to have legal cou=
nsel for the judgement and for the appeal but cannot afford to pay, does the=
 court have a duty to make sure I am on equal footings and have a fair and e=
quitable proceeding?
Who do I have to appeal to in order to have the MPS money to buy groceries?=
 Do I go to Social Services for food?
As you know, I initiated divorce proceedings four years ago because of dome=
stic abuse. Therefore, I will never, ever talk to the respondent or communic=
ate with him, which makes the judgement kind of sadistic. I also obviously h=
ave been asking for four years to have no contact with him. How do get an ap=
plication for a molestation order?=20
=20

Thank you very much. I will keep you posted.

=20

Nadia

=20

From: Brent Molyneux KC <BMolyneux@29br.co.uk>
Date: Monday, April 15, 2024 at 10:38 AM
To: Nadia <nadia@rosekross.com>, AFP BLOOM <Zoe.Bloom@afpbloom.com>
Subject: Re: Z v Z

=20

=20

Hi Nadia

As you can see from the document the corrections and obvious errors were ty=
pos, a couple of errors on the maths, and a couple of points where my recoll=
ection (as opposed to interpretation) of the evidence differed from factual =
statements in the judgment.

As it happens these are exactly the errors / omissions I  would have identi=
fied had I been instructed by you. Of course I made clear that this was with=
out prejudice to your right to produce your own errors / omissions.

You will need to obtain your own representation urgently and they will advi=
se you on the strict time limits for appealing and the procedure you must fo=
llow (if that is what you wish to do)

Best wishes

Brent=20

=20

Sent from Outlook for iOS


