Subject: Re: Z v Z=20

=20

=20

Dear Brent,

=20

Can you please confirm if in the matter of the draft judgement you are assi=
sting the court or representing my children and me, our best interests, our =
safety, and protecting us from threats, danger, and direct harm.=20

=20

I need a clear and unambiguous answer.

=20

With kind wishes,

Nadia

=20

