=20

Dear Karen

=20

I attach a list of what I have identified as corrections / errors.

=20

I do so, mindful as I am of my obligation to try and help the Court and his=
 Lordship, and because I received your email inviting me to assist.

=20

I must however add that I am not instructed by Mrs. Zahmoul and she will al=
most certainly have her own list of corrections / errors /  material omissio=
ns that she will wish to provide to you.  Please do not treat the attached d=
ocument as a substitution or replacement for anything which Mrs. Zahmoul, ac=
ting in person, may wish the judge to consider. That is not the purpose or i=
ntent of the document which I am attaching. It is simply an attempt to help.=
=20

=20

With best wishes

=20

Brent Molyneux


